    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners what Acts 4 teaches about corporate prayer and what Jesus promised in Matthew 18:20.",
    mcq1: ["What did the believers ask for in Acts 4:29?", ["Boldness to speak God's word", "Safety from all threats", "Wealth", "Revenge"], 0, "They asked to speak the word with boldness."],
    mcq2: ["What does Matthew 18:20 promise?", ["Where two or three are gathered in my name, there am I among them", "Only large groups are heard", "Public prayer is required", "God hears only priests"], 0, "Jesus promises his presence where two or three gather."],
